#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:40
#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:56
#: patterns/faq-section.php:38
msgid "To enable Full Site Editing in WordPress, you need to ensure that you are using a compatible WordPress theme that supports Full Site Editing. You will also need to install the latest version of WordPress and enable the Gutenberg editor."
